app TodoApp:
    purpose:
        Help people track tasks.

    requires:
        Users can create tasks.
        Users can mark tasks as done.
        Users can delete tasks.
        Tasks should persist after refresh.

    action:
        Create a simple task tracking application.
        Keep the experience clear enough for non-programmers to review.

    examples:
        When a user adds "Buy milk", it appears in the task list.
        When a user marks "Buy milk" as done, it moves to completed tasks.

    frontend:
        stack: react
        descriptions:
            Show a clean task list.
            Include an input for adding new tasks.
            Show active and completed tasks separately.

    backend:
        stack: fastapi
        descriptions:
            Provide APIs for creating, listing, updating, and deleting tasks.
            Validate that task titles are not empty.

    database:
        stack: sqlite
        descriptions:
            Store tasks with title, status, and created time.

    deploy:
        target: aws-ec2
        descriptions:
            Deploy the generated app to an EC2 server.
        credentials:
            env
